desc: Position probe (test tool, not a plugin to use)
// Designed by Rozaya, developed with Claude (Anthropic). CC0.
//
// Reports what REAPER tells a plugin about time, so the kin bridge can read it out of
// its manifest while it moves the cursor, plays, pauses, stops and loops. Built
// 2026-09-12 to find out whether a plugin can follow the song position with the
// transport stopped: Rozaya heard Melody respond to cursor movement, mechanism unknown.
// Passes audio through untouched. Every slider is a READOUT; setting one does nothing.

slider1:0<-10,10,1>play_state (0 stop, 1 play, 2 pause, 5 rec)
slider2:0<-100000,100000,0.001>play_position (seconds)
slider3:0<-100000,100000,0.001>beat_position (beats)
slider4:0<0,1000000,1>@init runs (survives @init, restored with the project)
slider5:0<0,100000000,1>@block runs since the last @init
slider6:0<0,100000000,0.001>seconds of audio since the last @init
slider7:0<0,1000,0.001>tempo (BPM)
slider8:0<0,1000000,1>@slider runs since the last @init

@init
slider4 += 1;
blocks = 0;
samples = 0;
sliders = 0;
sliderchange(-1);

@slider
sliders += 1;

@block
blocks += 1;
slider1 = play_state;
slider2 = play_position;
slider3 = beat_position;
slider5 = blocks;
slider6 = samples / srate;
slider7 = tempo;
slider8 = sliders;
sliderchange(-1);

@sample
samples += 1;
